  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Let us make man in our image, Gen. 1:26 (Moses 2:26). Who hath made man’s mouth? or who maketh the dumb, Ex. 4:11. in six days the Lord made heaven and earth, Ex. 20:11 (31:17). make us gods, which shall go before us, Ex. 32:1 (Acts 7:40). Lord said unto Moses, Make thee a fiery serpent, Num. 21:8. I will make them rulers over you, Deut. 1:13. not make the son of the beloved firstborn before the son of the hated, Deut. 21:16. The Lord maketh poor, and maketh rich, 1 Sam. 2:7. He maketh the storm a calm, Ps. 107:29. Which made heaven, Ps. 146:6 (Acts 4:24). all those things hath mine hand made, Isa. 66:2 (Acts 7:50). He hath made the earth by his power, Jer. 51:15.",
